  "decision": "Accept W8A16-G128 as an experimental bounded routed-expert runtime path. It passes the complete-layer numerical gate and materially reduces routed payload and layer latency, but it remains default-off until persistent packed artifacts, multi-layer final-logit parity, and measured end-to-end decode throughput exist. The next bottleneck is device-resident attention and trunk execution rather than routed-expert weight traffic alone."
